OL,3,GNEWSAAgencies pledge to learn from
OL,4,Atriple killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and health leaders are
OL,7,Freflecting on inquest findings which
OL,8,Fsaid failures by agencies contributed
OL,9,Fto the killing of a pair of elderly
OL,10,Ftwins and another elderly man by a man
OL,11,Fsuffering a psychotic episode, agency
OL,12,Fbosses say.
OL,14,FAnthony Payne, 80, and Dick and Roger
OL,15,FCarter, 84, were attacked by Alexander
OL,16,FLewis-Ranwell in Exeter, Devon, in
OL,17,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
