OL,3,GNEWSAAgencies pledge to learn from
OL,4,Atriple killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury criticised a failure to
OL,7,Fcarry out a mental health assessment on
OL,8,FLewis-Ranwell and failures by police to
OL,9,Funderstand powers to detain him under
OL,10,Fthe Mental Health Act.
OL,12,FDevon and Cornwall Police Assistant
OL,13,FChief Constable Nikki Leaper said the
OL,14,Fforce was addressing "areas of learning
OL,15,Fand change" and accepted" the jury's
OL,16,Ffindings.
